# --- 建置輸出 (Build Output) ---
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
publish/

# --- 使用者設定與快取 ---
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- 套件管理 (NuGet) ---
# 現代 .NET 通常不需要排除 packages/ 因為它們存放在全域快取
# 但如果你有本機套件夾則需排除
packages/
*.nupkg

# --- 測試結果 ---
TestResults/
/performance/

# --- 敏感資訊 (建議排除) ---
appsettings.Development.json
secrets.json

# --- 作業系統 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- 暫存與 Log ---
*.log